  "_disclaimer": "Historical total returns over fixed windows ending on the asof date. These returns are NOT a backtest of the framework's predictive power \u2014 the curated inputs (ROIC, moat, vintage, regulatory) are frozen at the most recent review and cannot be recomputed historically. Survivorship bias applies: companies that scored well in past years and exited the universe are not represented here."
}